  quarantineExitLines:
  - I am not sick. It is a dress. People wear dresses.
  - Is there a window? I like to see if it rains.
  killExitLines:
  - "I thought\u2026 I was sure there was still time\u2026"
  - "Will someone tell them\u2026 I tried to\u2026"
